{"id":"zametno","lemma":"заметно","pos":"adv","rank":2883,"glosses":["noticeably, perceptibly, visibly (capable of being seen or noticed)","markedly, conspicuously","outstandingly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/db/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Оно едва заметно.","en":"It's hardly noticeable.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"hardly, barely"},null]},{"text":"Это не так заметно.","en":"It's not that noticeable.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"wrong"]]},{"text":"Когда любишь своё дело, это заметно.","en":"When you love what you do, it shows.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"affair"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"А разве заметно?","en":"Does it show?","words":[{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"really"},null]},{"text":"Он заметно нервничал.","en":"He was visibly nervous.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to be nervous","l":"нервничать"}]}]}